{
  "_help": [
    "Haircuts: one source skin per style (hair drawn on a 64x64 slim skin). The generator splits each style into colour zones",
    "(main, decor_1, decor_2) and writes textures/character/haircuts/<id>/<slim|classic>/ and appearance/haircuts.json.",
    "zones: the colour fields the player can tint; kind is hair or decor (decides the palette).",
    "rules: checked in order for every pixel, the first matching \"when\" puts it into \"zone\"; otherwise it belongs to main.",
    "gradient: the pixel is split between main and decor_1 by \"weight\" (clamped to 0..1); \"where\" limits it, elsewhere the weight is 0.",
    "Styles with a single zone get generated shade maps: a second hair field for the drawn shadows.",
    "Formulas: r g b lum h s v x y group face surface; + - * / > >= < <= == != && || ( ) and 'text'."
  ],
  "zone_labels": {
    "main": "Цвет волос",
    "decor_1": "Цвет декораций 1",
    "decor_2": "Цвет декораций 2"
  },
